            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>The front and basement doors need to have weatherstrip replaced or adjusted

There is plenty of cold air coming through the combustion air opening, this wil be different once the new furnace is installed

There are also air leaks around where the wire conduits are by the electrical panel</airSeal>
                <VentilationSystem>Consider upgrading the ventilation fan to an HRV for lower cost of operation



The range hood fan ductwork needs to be completed over the cabinets and out through the rim joists in the basement </VentilationSystem>
            </RURComments>
